+        "$comment": "Goldfish return check while the worker still exists (candidate 23). A marked Goldfish's own SubagentHandback is validated against its binding before the child is gone, because SubagentStop has no channel back to the worker or the Coordinator; live, a return cut off after its report lost the host commit silently. Allows every unmarked child and every fault, and stops refusing after three attempts. Whether Claude fires PreToolUse for this host tool is proven only by a live run.",
+        "matcher": "SubagentHandback",
+        "hooks": [
+          {
+            "type": "command",
+            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/native-goldfish-host.mjs\" --runner claude",
+            "timeout": 120
+          }
+        ]
